OL,3,AVenezuela to scrap law that bars
OL,4,Aopposition from public office
OL,5,
OL,6,FVenezuela will repeal a law that bars
OL,7,Fopposition figures from assuming public
OL,8,Foffice, the speaker of the National
OL,9,FAssembly Jorge Rodriguez has said.
OL,11,FThe legislation, which was introduced
OL,12,Ftwo years ago, has been criticised for
OL,13,Fenabling political persecution, but
OL,14,FRodriguez said no politician had been
OL,15,Fsubjected to its provisions.
OL,17,FThe older brother of Venezuela's
OL,18,Finterim president Delcy Rodriguez said
OL,19,Fhe expected the reforms to be approved
OL,20,Fnext week.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
