OL,3,AVenezuela to scrap law that bars
OL,4,Aopposition from public office
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelcy Rodriguez's interim government
OL,7,Fhas been negotiating with opposition
OL,8,Fparties since taking over at the start
OL,9,Fof the year, when former President
OL,10,FNicolas Maduro was seized by the United
OL,11,FStates.
